The registration is free, maximum number of competitors is 130.
Please give us as soon as possible the exact number of guests coming with you **and their names.**

There is a restriction on the registration to the following events, you can only chose 3 out of these 6 events : 
- 6x6 cube; 
- 7x7 cube; 
- Rubik's Clock; 
- 4x4 blindfolded; 
- 5x5 blindfolded, 
- 3x3 multiple blindfolded.

If you register for more than 3 of these events, your registration may be deleted if you don't answer us.
Due to venue restriction we expect the maximum number of competitors to be reached. If this number is reached, and since the competition is free, we will ask you to confirm your registration some weeks before the competition. If you don't answer this email your registration may be deleted.

Please register only if you are sure to come: keep in mind that not showing up to the competition may prevent someone else from competing!
